    <p class="eyebrow">Model tracker</p>
    <h1>Open-weight models from Chinese labs</h1>
    <p>Recent open-weight releases, newest repository first within each lab. Every value comes from the model's own repository: the model card, its configuration file, or its license file. A blank or general entry means the card does not state more.</p>
    <p class="activity">Checked <time datetime="2026-11-04">4 November 2026</time>. Dates are the month the repository was created, which can differ from the announcement. Read <a href="/notes/reading-an-open-weight-model-card.html">how to read a model card</a> before comparing rows.</p>

